      "id": "claim_ab735f20397d43fa9a7412810dfd7857",
      "statement": "Reborn's architecture uses a four-layer model: Products (CLI, WebUI, Slack, Telegram), Userland (Agent loops), Kernel (Authorization and policy gates), and Substrate (Events, Filesystem, Memory). The kernel is the security perimeter; loops request effects and the kernel decides what is allowed.",
