      "statement": "A user turn flows through the system from product submission (CLI/WebUI) through TurnCoordinator for admission, TurnRunner for lease and scheduling, AgentLoop for strategy execution, CapabilityHost for authorization, and Kernel gates for policy enforcement, finally executing in Substrate with durable event emission.",
