    {
      "id": "claim_12b8fc2faf844f21b96d471d720afa11",
      "statement": "Extensions are the sole installable product objects that declare tool capabilities, channel integrations (Slack, Telegram, WebUI, CLI), auth integrations (OAuth2, API keys), and memory providers. The generic host handles installation, credential binding, and multi-user lifecycle without naming concrete vendors.",
