      "id": "claim_8c4fade851024b6b92c8ab9455b88f94",
      "statement": "Every meaningful state transition in the system (turn accepted, run started, capability invoked, approval resolved) emits an immutable event appended to a durable append-only event log. Projections replay the event log to compute read models; the event log serves as the complete audit trail and enables deterministic replay.",
