    {
      "id": "claim_866db7bb00b54a43b3dc1cd69451a4c5",
      "statement": "Reborn consists of 68+ crates organized into 7 groups: Core Contracts (5 crates), Authority & Gates (9 crates), Capability Execution (11 crates), Durable State (9 crates), Products & Loops (27 crates), Storage Backends (8 crates), and Utilities (7 crates). Dependencies flow upward only: Substrate ← Kernel ← Userland ← Products.",
