    {
      "id": "claim_1dcab0ff78e444759a4a20db8b962f53",
      "statement": "IronClaw runs two parallel architectures: v1 (maintenance-only monolith in src/ with ~10k LOC) and Reborn (modern modular development target in crates/ with 68+ focused crates). New features must be built in Reborn, not v1.",
